<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-ESPANYOL SACK COACH MIERA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ESPANYOL SACK COACH MIERA.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Struggling Spanish first division side Espanyol sacked coach Vicente Miera on Thursday and replaced him with reserve coach Paco Flores.</p>
<p>Hid dismissal followed the team's Spanish Cup defeat by second division Las Palmas on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Espanyol have slumped to 20th in the league after finishing fourth last year.</p>
</text>
